    <description><![CDATA[<h4><br></h4><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">00:06</a></span></strong></h4><span></span><blockquote><span>"无限灵魂进入肉身之后，究竟是什么限制了我们？"</span><br><span></span></blockquote><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">00:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a></span></strong></h4><span></span><blockquote><span>"小我既然带个‘我’字，就注定无法被破除！它本就是‘我’的一部分。"</span><br><span></span></blockquote><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a></span></strong></h4><span></span><p><strong><span>二元性理论</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>"世界是巨大的二元，只有经历小我的自卑，才懂什么是高我的自信。"</span><br><span></span></blockquote><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span></strong></h4><span></span><p><strong><span>厌蠢现象分析</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>"为什么我们懂‘虚怀若谷’，却忍不住厌蠢？根源在灵魂投胎前的傲慢！"</span><br><span></span></blockquote><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a></span></strong></h4><span></span><p><strong><span>修行方法论</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>"小我是阴性能量，高我是阳性能量——修行不是剥离，而是阴阳合一！"</span><br><span></span></blockquote><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a></span></strong><span>：</span></h4><span></span><blockquote><span>"若你批判小我的‘负面’，等于从旧二元跳进新二元！"</span><br><span></span></blockquote><span></span><h3><br></h3>]]></description>
