    <title>[灵媒说]如何用“合一”修行，拥有恐怖执行力，解决拖延，焦虑，内耗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b1d20f05a90dfd0dcfe1c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b1d20f05a90dfd0dcfe1c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Feb 2025 12:00:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h4><strong><span>本期重点金句：</span></strong></h4><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><strong><span>“我们每个人都是一个小宇宙，内在能量的统一是行动力的源泉。”</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ol><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a></span></strong><span>：提出问题——为什么我们明明知道什么是对的，却总是拖延或无法行动？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a></span></strong><span>：引入“合一”概念，探讨它是否能帮助创造行动力。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a></span></strong><span>：解释“合一”在宇宙学说中的含义，即天人合一，强调我们与宇宙、与自我的统一性。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a></span></strong><span>：从脉轮理论出发，说明内在能量统一与行动力的关系。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a></span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>重点案例</span></strong><span>——通过个案分析，揭示内在年龄与外在年龄不匹配导致的内耗问题。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a></span></strong><span>：探讨心脑合一的重要性，指出大脑与内心的冲突如何阻碍行动力。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a></span></strong><span>：总结合一的力量，强调内在整合如何帮助我们专注行动、创造人生价值。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a></span></strong><span>：结束语，鼓励观众关注修行与生活的结合。</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
