    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Dec 2024 13:16:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这里是【玄知解她惑】的第02期节目！本期节目，资深灵媒告诉你，拥有感知万物的超能力是什么体验？最强大脑「水哥」是拥有什么样的超强「通感天赋」？「通感天赋」都有哪些类型？本期节目揭秘！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> </span></strong><span>到底什么是通感天赋？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> </span></strong><span>共振的烦恼：脆弱如林黛玉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a> 天</span></strong><span>赋原来是“工具”，用得越多越顺手</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> </span></strong><span>灵魂连线，高维“聊天”的奇妙体验</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a> </span></strong><span>水哥的高阶超能力：脑子就像高精度摄像机</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1639">27:19</a> </span></strong><span>普通人怎么开“天眼”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1768">29:28</a> </span></strong><span>五感开挂，嗅觉听觉都是超能力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">36:46</a> </span></strong><span>耐心也算一种天赋？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">37:27</a> </span></strong><span>找到自己的天赋，人人都有超能力</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnhnNxKShCUHNEUxprK8r6ZCrZoQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期参与者】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>原大人（前教育公司创始人, 美国奥秘学院认证灵性教师，美国认证潜意识重建疗愈师，10W+灵性读书会老师）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tina甜甜（职业规划师，哥伦比亚大学硕士，前互联网大厂/世界500强，小红书/B站/抖音/视频号：甜甜姐聊求职）</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑制作：树苗、甜甜</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：夏日漱石</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢这档节目，欢迎添加 HERo_se11 加入听友群，期待更多交流！</span></p>]]></description>
